WEBVTT

01:31.823 --> 01:37.141
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.141 --> 01:40.200
[Episode 2]

01:40.200 --> 01:41.560
- My lady, watch your step.
- Okay.

02:00.776 --> 02:06.120
♫ The Luo River cleanses the moonlight haze ♫

02:06.629 --> 02:12.009
♫ Flowing into a scorching long river ♫

02:13.032 --> 02:18.344
♫ A jade-like face not yet indulged
in mundane pleasures ♫

02:18.344 --> 02:25.457
♫ Youth sets its own wandering path ♫

02:27.506 --> 02:30.632
♫ Let not the secular world constrain ♫

02:30.632 --> 02:33.800
♫ How can they guess with mundane eyes ♫

02:33.800 --> 02:40.296
♫ Smiling as the storm stir the dust ♫

02:40.296 --> 02:44.247
♫ Flowers should bloom proudly ♫

02:44.247 --> 02:45.960
♫ Reflecting the color of the sky ♫

02:45.960 --> 02:47.848
♫ Never withering ♫

02:47.848 --> 02:54.576
♫ Do not fail the varied fragrance ♫

03:01.448 --> 03:04.424
♫ Let not the secular world constrain ♫

03:04.424 --> 03:07.560
♫ How can they guess with mundane eyes ♫

03:07.560 --> 03:13.928
♫ Smiling as the storm stir the dust ♫

03:13.928 --> 03:17.569
♫ Flowers should bloom proudly ♫

03:17.569 --> 03:19.933
♫ Reflecting the color of the sky ♫

03:19.933 --> 03:21.984
♫ Never withering ♫

03:21.984 --> 03:27.319
♫ Do not fail the varied fragrance ♫

03:27.319 --> 03:28.879
Minister Chen.

03:28.879 --> 03:30.400
I've heard that your son

03:30.400 --> 03:32.680
would soon go to the capital
to take the imperial examination.

03:32.680 --> 03:33.719
My own son also wishes to participate

03:33.719 --> 03:35.159
in this year's Provincial Examination.

03:35.159 --> 03:36.960
Why not let them
travel to the capital together?

03:37.919 --> 03:40.039
My son has gained
the favor of the County Princess

03:40.039 --> 03:42.000
and is bound to be promoted.

03:42.560 --> 03:45.039
In the future, our two families
should interact more

03:45.039 --> 03:47.080
and support each other in official circles.

03:47.080 --> 03:48.800
It will be beneficial.

03:51.759 --> 03:54.520
Whoever forms an alliance with Prince Ning

03:54.520 --> 03:56.680
will become my comrade.

03:57.960 --> 04:00.120
The Floral Envoy accompanies
the County Princess

04:00.120 --> 04:01.680
to relax here.

04:02.479 --> 04:05.080
It's obvious who is the son-in-law

04:05.080 --> 04:06.919
favored by His Highness.

04:06.919 --> 04:10.199
I must remind you

04:10.840 --> 04:14.120
to beware lest all your efforts be in vain.

04:33.240 --> 04:34.680
Your Highness, we have arrived.

04:58.360 --> 05:00.720
Greetings, Princess.

05:20.240 --> 05:22.839
- No need for formalities.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.368
Your Highness.

05:45.360 --> 05:46.800
Zishu.

05:46.800 --> 05:48.199
Long time no see.

05:48.879 --> 05:49.920
How have you been recently?

05:52.120 --> 05:53.480
All is well.

05:53.480 --> 05:55.199
I've heard about what happened.

05:55.199 --> 05:57.839
Please don't worry too much, Your Highness.

06:04.319 --> 06:05.600
The floral banquet is ready.

06:05.600 --> 06:07.360
Please invite the Floral Envoy.

06:08.120 --> 06:10.519
The Envoy is resting after the tiring journey.

06:10.519 --> 06:12.319
Please wait a moment.

06:12.319 --> 06:13.832
Very well, very well.

06:17.439 --> 06:19.399
My lord, it's time to get up.

06:19.399 --> 06:20.808
Everyone is waiting for you.

06:54.800 --> 06:57.199
Greetings, Floral Envoy.

06:59.959 --> 07:01.160
Greetings to everyone.

07:05.600 --> 07:08.000
Where did you get drunk last night?

07:08.000 --> 07:10.279
You slept all the way and made us wait.

07:11.720 --> 07:13.399
I wanted to leave more time

07:13.399 --> 07:15.399
for the County Princess' pleasantries.

07:15.399 --> 07:18.399
Mr. Liu, you wouldn't blame me, right

07:18.399 --> 07:19.519
Of course not.

07:19.519 --> 07:21.759
The presence of the County
Princess and Floral Envoy

07:21.759 --> 07:24.040
is honoring to my house.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.240
Come, please.

07:45.000 --> 07:46.280
My lady.

07:47.839 --> 07:49.079
Your Highness, please.

07:51.120 --> 07:52.240
Please watch your step.

07:56.120 --> 07:58.680
This environment and these flowers
have been specially prepared

07:58.680 --> 08:00.000
for your arrival.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.279
Your Highness, look over there.

08:02.279 --> 08:04.160
There are a few very rare varieties.

08:05.199 --> 08:06.440
Come on, have a look.

08:07.879 --> 08:09.120
It's really beautiful.

08:15.720 --> 08:17.879
The Luoyang officialdom is
full of hidden talents.

08:18.399 --> 08:19.439
Mr. Liu has put in great effort

08:20.040 --> 08:21.560
to gather so many

08:21.560 --> 08:23.560
renowned items rarely seen even in Chang'an.

08:25.079 --> 08:28.639
My daughter-in-law is skilled
at cultivating peonies.

08:28.639 --> 08:31.040
She can cultivate
even the most novel varieties.

08:31.040 --> 08:32.600
Floral Envoy, if there's any you want,

08:32.600 --> 08:34.519
you can take it home to enjoy
to your heart's content.

08:35.480 --> 08:36.960
That's your dowry, my lady.

08:39.200 --> 08:40.879
If they belong to the young lady.

08:41.480 --> 08:42.879
I'll pass.

08:42.879 --> 08:43.960
A true gentleman

08:43.960 --> 08:45.000
does not take what others love.

08:46.080 --> 08:47.240
Today, I wanted

08:47.240 --> 08:49.440
to adorn my hair with fresh flowers.

08:49.440 --> 08:50.960
But the inn was so shabby

08:50.960 --> 08:53.039
that I couldn't find a suitable one.

08:54.240 --> 08:56.080
But this garden full of peonies

08:56.080 --> 08:57.559
does seem fitting.

08:59.080 --> 09:00.320
This one, right? I see.

09:00.320 --> 09:01.576
Hold on.

09:09.120 --> 09:10.200
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

09:11.320 --> 09:12.679
the peonies are flattered

09:13.320 --> 09:14.679
by your affection.

09:15.200 --> 09:16.639
But these peonies

09:16.639 --> 09:19.279
are the dowry given by my father and mother.

09:19.879 --> 09:21.480
Even if I am dull,

09:21.480 --> 09:22.960
I dare not be unfilial.

09:22.960 --> 09:25.080
I hope Your Highness can show mercy.

09:25.879 --> 09:27.840
Whether you are filial or not

09:27.840 --> 09:29.000
is of no consequence to me.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.600
Youzhen.

09:35.600 --> 09:37.639
Since it is her dowry, let it be.

09:40.639 --> 09:42.639
Zishu, it's just a flower.

09:42.639 --> 09:43.679
Can't you bear to part with it?

09:44.519 --> 09:45.759
But…

09:45.759 --> 09:47.799
As the daughter of the imperial family,

09:47.799 --> 09:49.679
you must have seen all the rare things.

09:50.559 --> 09:52.440
To be honest,

09:52.440 --> 09:53.600
these peonies

09:53.600 --> 09:55.080
are just ordinary flowers

09:55.080 --> 09:56.600
in your eyes, Your Highness.

09:56.600 --> 09:58.159
But to me,

09:58.159 --> 10:00.159
they are of considerable value
to carry with oneself.

10:01.200 --> 10:03.159
I hope you can show leniency.

10:03.159 --> 10:05.720
Why bother quibbling with a woman
of no significance like me?

10:07.240 --> 10:08.600
After all is said and done,

10:08.600 --> 10:10.120
it's all about money.

10:10.879 --> 10:12.279
Indeed.

10:12.279 --> 10:15.039
Peonies are flowers in our eyes.

10:15.039 --> 10:16.919
But in the eyes of merchants,

10:16.919 --> 10:18.639
they are nuggets of gold.

10:19.879 --> 10:21.399
That's true, Your Highness.

10:22.279 --> 10:24.679
As long as we take the branches of these
flowers, plant them in the soil,

10:24.679 --> 10:26.120
and tend to them diligently,

10:26.120 --> 10:28.799
next Spring, they will bloom,
one flower becoming two.

10:28.799 --> 10:30.440
They're more than just nuggets of gold.

10:30.440 --> 10:33.120
They're practically a wealth-bringing
deity that generates money annually.

10:35.399 --> 10:36.552
Enough.

10:40.200 --> 10:41.720
My wife is a vulgar huckster

10:41.720 --> 10:43.120
and has offended the County Princess.

10:43.120 --> 10:44.840
Your Highness,

10:44.840 --> 10:46.320
please don't stoop to her level.

10:53.039 --> 10:55.039
The County Princess is naturally beautiful.

10:55.039 --> 10:56.360
Even without fresh flowers adorning her,

10:56.360 --> 10:57.600
her grace stands out.

10:58.639 --> 11:00.519
Other vulgar powders and
rogue creams in the garden

11:00.519 --> 11:01.720
cannot hold a candle to her.

11:02.759 --> 11:03.759
Let it be.

11:03.759 --> 11:05.399
Let's leave these nuggets of gold

11:05.399 --> 11:06.440
to the young lady.

11:09.200 --> 11:10.720
I am magnanimous.

11:10.720 --> 11:11.816
So be it.

11:12.679 --> 11:13.840
Thank you, Your Highness.

11:15.320 --> 11:16.399
Your Highness.

11:16.399 --> 11:19.840
Allow me to take you to the Water Jade
Pavilion for a rest. This way, please.

11:19.840 --> 11:20.960
Your Highness.

11:29.960 --> 11:31.240
To do as one says,

11:33.080 --> 11:34.360
I've come to help you

11:34.360 --> 11:35.600
get rid of the troublemakers.

11:36.320 --> 11:38.559
Do you want the 100-set way

11:39.120 --> 11:40.759
or the 80-set way?

11:42.200 --> 11:45.320
I won't let go of even a single flower.
I am very stingy.

11:45.840 --> 11:47.840
So how can I afford to summon the Floral Envoy?

11:49.720 --> 11:51.200
Moreover,

11:51.200 --> 11:52.600
my own troublemakers

11:52.600 --> 11:54.240
should rightfully be dealt with by myself.

11:55.240 --> 11:56.399
No need to trouble you.

11:59.159 --> 12:00.424
Floral Envoy.

12:02.759 --> 12:03.960
Keeper Chen.

12:06.159 --> 12:07.399
Long time no see.

12:07.399 --> 12:09.480
You are as dashing and suave as ever.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.840
The Liu Mansion has never
been this lively before.

12:14.759 --> 12:17.320
Look at the lady of the house
with that sycophantic look,

12:17.320 --> 12:19.240
they even mock you for being vulgar.

12:19.240 --> 12:20.759
Where are they any better?

12:22.440 --> 12:23.440
If I don't pretend to be

12:23.440 --> 12:24.559
greedy for money,

12:25.159 --> 12:27.480
how could the County Princess have
so easily given up just now?

12:28.879 --> 12:30.159
These peonies

12:30.159 --> 12:32.200
are the keepsakes my mother left me.

12:32.200 --> 12:33.799
I must protect them.

12:33.799 --> 12:35.840
What does it matter
if people disdain me a little?

12:37.840 --> 12:39.208
Are you here for the flowers?

12:41.000 --> 12:42.344
There are more over there.

12:43.039 --> 12:44.320
How brazen.

12:44.320 --> 12:46.600
Don't say that. These are
the young lady's golden goose.

12:51.279 --> 12:53.720
The County Princess looks at
the lord with deep affection.

12:53.720 --> 12:55.919
She must have old feelings for him.

12:55.919 --> 12:57.679
That's why she deliberately made
things difficult for you, my lady.

12:58.279 --> 12:59.879
It doesn't matter.

12:59.879 --> 13:01.159
If Liu Chang and the County Princess

13:01.159 --> 13:02.519
wish to rekindle their past relationship,

13:03.120 --> 13:04.279
they certainly won't make room for me.

13:05.159 --> 13:07.399
If he initiates the divorce,

13:07.399 --> 13:09.360
it would be the Liu family breaking
the marriage contract first.

13:10.600 --> 13:12.080
I have no reason not to agree.

13:12.799 --> 13:13.879
To me,

13:14.399 --> 13:15.759
this may be a good opportunity.

13:16.519 --> 13:18.080
But once divorced,

13:18.080 --> 13:20.320
others will regard you as a cast-off wife.

13:20.320 --> 13:22.039
Arranging another marriage later on might be…

13:22.039 --> 13:23.519
Silly Yulu.

13:23.519 --> 13:24.559
Life

13:24.559 --> 13:25.840
is yours to live.

13:26.360 --> 13:27.919
Why bother about others' views?

13:29.039 --> 13:31.159
These two are the daughters of Commandant Wang.

13:31.159 --> 13:33.200
Heye, Hehua.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.399
Greet the Floral Envoy.

13:34.399 --> 13:35.720
I've always thought

13:35.720 --> 13:37.720
that corrupt officials are either fat-headed

13:37.720 --> 13:39.559
or weasel-faced.

13:39.559 --> 13:41.200
I've never expected the Floral Envoy

13:41.200 --> 13:42.799
to be so dashing and handsome.

13:43.399 --> 13:45.320
Look at those unmarried ladies.

13:45.320 --> 13:47.240
Their eyes are practically glued to him.

13:48.200 --> 13:49.240
Common folks

13:49.240 --> 13:51.399
tending to their own plot of land

13:52.039 --> 13:53.320
are seen as vulgar and coarse

13:53.320 --> 13:54.679
in their eyes.

13:55.559 --> 13:57.399
While the officials insatiably greedy

13:57.399 --> 13:58.519
who accept bribes

13:59.080 --> 14:00.200
are the best marriage material

14:00.200 --> 14:01.799
and the ladder to climb up the ranks

14:01.799 --> 14:03.480
in their eyes.

14:04.240 --> 14:05.399
The Current Officialdom

14:06.360 --> 14:08.399
is becoming more and more miasmic.

14:09.120 --> 14:10.159
Ladies and gentlemen.

14:10.159 --> 14:11.320
Noon has arrived.

14:11.320 --> 14:13.080
Please take your seats.

14:13.080 --> 14:14.280
Please.

14:36.159 --> 14:38.159
Mr. Chen, apologies
for the imperfect hospitality.

14:38.159 --> 14:39.480
This is a small token of my feelings.

14:40.799 --> 14:42.159
Come, please.

14:42.159 --> 14:43.240
Mr. Chen.

14:43.240 --> 14:44.328
Please.

14:46.879 --> 14:48.720
- After you.
- Please.

14:49.960 --> 14:51.399
Your Highness, please.

14:51.399 --> 14:52.480
Please take the upper seat.

15:07.120 --> 15:08.159
The County Princess

15:08.159 --> 15:10.159
actually took the seat
of the Liu family's young lady.

15:10.159 --> 15:12.279
Isn't this openly slapping Madam He's face?

15:12.919 --> 15:14.279
The County Princess, recently widowed,

15:14.279 --> 15:15.279
went nowhere

15:15.279 --> 15:16.639
but Luoyang.

15:17.799 --> 15:18.919
This Mr. Liu

15:18.919 --> 15:20.480
is a minor judge today,

15:20.480 --> 15:23.960
but in the future, he might just be
transferred to the capital and rise rapidly.

15:29.519 --> 15:31.519
Your Highness, this is not proper etiquette.

15:32.440 --> 15:34.720
Zishu, it has been a long time since I saw you.

15:34.720 --> 15:36.159
I don't want to be too far from you.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.360
Please, sit down.

15:46.240 --> 15:47.840
My lady, shall we…

15:47.840 --> 15:49.799
It's alright.

15:49.799 --> 15:51.360
There are seats over there, let's go.

15:57.480 --> 15:59.440
This garden is full of peonies.

15:59.440 --> 16:01.279
There's no place for the Albizia flower.

16:02.600 --> 16:03.960
No flowers, no fruit.

16:05.279 --> 16:06.480
It does match.

16:18.200 --> 16:19.679
Zishu, sit down.

16:20.264 --> 16:21.448
Okay.

16:27.120 --> 16:28.679
This family of troublemakers

16:30.120 --> 16:31.279
is truly interesting.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.000
This wine is good.

17:46.039 --> 17:47.208
Chuanyu.

17:47.839 --> 17:49.400
My lord.

17:49.400 --> 17:52.599
How is this dance compared to the Pear Garden

17:52.599 --> 17:53.864
in the palace?

17:55.319 --> 17:56.559
Naturally, it can't compete.

17:57.440 --> 17:59.640
But it is quite presentable.

18:00.960 --> 18:02.960
It's more than just presentable.

18:04.000 --> 18:06.599
The look in the eyes and the posture
of holding an umbrella

18:06.599 --> 18:08.400
clearly have a familiar

18:10.119 --> 18:11.640
murderous aura

18:15.200 --> 18:16.240
of martial artists.

18:24.640 --> 18:25.799
Youzhen, be careful.

18:30.119 --> 18:31.559
Protect the County Princess.

18:31.559 --> 18:32.839
My lady, get up quickly.

18:32.839 --> 18:33.992
Quickly.

18:38.472 --> 18:39.559
Go.

18:39.559 --> 18:40.840
Don't move.

18:45.160 --> 18:46.559
Treacherous official Jiang,

18:46.559 --> 18:49.079
you let the emperor indulge in pleasure,
bringing chaos to the court hierarchy.

18:49.079 --> 18:50.359
The Integrity Society is here

18:50.359 --> 18:51.519
to act for heaven.

18:52.240 --> 18:53.559
Overestimating one's own ability.

18:54.759 --> 18:55.799
Does the Floral Envoy know kung fu?

18:57.000 --> 18:58.119
I've never heard of it.

18:58.119 --> 18:59.559
This is an imperial sword
bestowed by His Majesty.

19:01.279 --> 19:02.839
When the sharp blade is unsheathed,

19:02.839 --> 19:04.279
it's as if His Majesty has arrived in person.

19:12.039 --> 19:13.680
What are you waiting for?

19:13.680 --> 19:14.720
Protect the royal sword.

19:27.359 --> 19:28.759
Be careful.

19:28.759 --> 19:30.119
Don't splatter blood everywhere.

19:30.799 --> 19:32.960
Staining the beautiful garments of the ladies

19:32.960 --> 19:34.079
would be a pity.

19:40.759 --> 19:41.799
Be careful, Yulu.

19:43.319 --> 19:46.039
Don't cut my flowers. Fight over there.

19:46.039 --> 19:47.272
My lady.

19:48.640 --> 19:50.200
My lady, you scared me.

19:50.200 --> 19:52.759
How could you just charge out like that?

19:52.759 --> 19:53.759
I was scared.

19:53.759 --> 19:55.279
I thought they had cut my flowers.

19:55.279 --> 19:57.160
- Are you alright?
- I'm fine, are you?

19:57.160 --> 19:58.880
- I'm okay.
- Control your strength well.

19:58.880 --> 20:00.000
Do not harm the flowers.

20:00.559 --> 20:02.680
The gold nuggets of the young Lady Liu

20:02.680 --> 20:04.160
are too expensive to compensate.

20:12.640 --> 20:14.240
He was previously acting as a ghost

20:14.240 --> 20:15.599
inside the Fuyun Temple.

20:15.599 --> 20:16.839
And now he fully reveals

20:16.839 --> 20:18.319
the posture of someone borrowing power.

20:19.119 --> 20:20.839
This favored one by His Majesty

20:20.839 --> 20:21.839
is indeed not ordinary.

20:23.039 --> 20:24.480
Kneel.

20:24.480 --> 20:26.039
It was due to my negligence

20:26.039 --> 20:27.480
in checking identities thoroughly

20:27.480 --> 20:29.319
that the thieves mixed into the assembly.

20:29.839 --> 20:32.079
Fortunately, the County Princess
was not injured.

20:32.079 --> 20:34.960
But still, it disturbed the elegant interest
of the County Princess and the Floral Envoy.

20:34.960 --> 20:36.599
Please forgive me.

20:41.359 --> 20:42.440
The Liu family failed to inspect

20:42.440 --> 20:44.519
and startled the County Princess
and the Floral Envoy.

20:44.519 --> 20:46.119
Please show great magnanimity

20:46.119 --> 20:47.160
and deal with it leniently.

20:48.440 --> 20:50.400
Zishu, what are you doing?

20:50.400 --> 20:51.784
Get up quickly.

20:53.039 --> 20:54.440
Get up.

20:56.799 --> 20:58.240
For the sake of you,

20:58.240 --> 20:59.752
I won't pursue it.

21:05.160 --> 21:06.480
What do you say, Floral Envoy?

21:16.440 --> 21:17.440
Forget it.

21:18.359 --> 21:20.359
This matter can't really be blamed on Lord Liu.

21:21.400 --> 21:22.480
You…

21:22.480 --> 21:23.599
It was just a matter of poor luck.

21:24.680 --> 21:27.000
If today the one receiving us
was the Keeper Chen,

21:27.000 --> 21:28.759
there would still be such a commotion.

21:31.119 --> 21:33.279
Assaults, assassination attempts.

21:33.960 --> 21:36.200
It happens several times each month.

21:36.200 --> 21:37.240
I'm already used to it.

21:37.839 --> 21:40.000
Look how skilled my subordinates are.

21:40.799 --> 21:43.039
Mr. Liu, no need to take it to heart.

21:44.359 --> 21:46.400
Everyone, get up.

21:46.400 --> 21:48.799
Thank you for your clemency,
Your Highness, Floral Envoy.

21:51.359 --> 21:53.640
Having committed many evils,
he has invited pursuit and killing.

21:53.640 --> 21:54.759
He doesn't take it as a warning,

21:55.799 --> 21:57.079
and yet, he's proud of it.

21:58.039 --> 22:00.319
You have broad minds.

22:00.319 --> 22:02.720
I am ashamed for not measuring up.

22:05.000 --> 22:06.599
Thank you, Your Highness.

22:06.599 --> 22:08.160
Didn't you change the way
of addressing me just now?

22:08.160 --> 22:09.400
Why are you reverting to it again?

22:10.599 --> 22:12.440
I still prefer you to call me by my name.

22:14.440 --> 22:16.440
Youzhen, it's chaos here.

22:16.440 --> 22:18.519
Let's go admire the flowers somewhere else

22:18.519 --> 22:20.559
so that the servants tidying up
won't bother you.

22:21.519 --> 22:23.359
- Okay.
- Please.

22:44.440 --> 22:45.680
Ladies and gentlemen.

22:46.440 --> 22:48.119
Thank you for coming.

22:48.119 --> 22:49.400
Please forgive me for my poor hospitality.

22:51.279 --> 22:52.599
Mr. Liu.

22:52.599 --> 22:53.640
You are humble.

22:54.759 --> 22:57.720
In today's floral banquet,
the peonies are dazzling.

22:57.720 --> 22:58.920
We

22:58.920 --> 23:01.240
were honored to feast our eyes

23:01.240 --> 23:02.519
in the light of the County Princess

23:02.519 --> 23:03.799
and the Floral Envoy.

23:05.799 --> 23:08.799
The County Princess and the Floral
Envoy are staying here.

23:08.799 --> 23:11.640
It will certainly lead to many banquets
and feasts in the future.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.880
Our two families

23:12.880 --> 23:14.240
must interact with each other more frequently.

23:15.839 --> 23:16.920
Of course.

23:19.319 --> 23:20.720
Floral Envoy.

23:20.720 --> 23:23.079
This banquet cannot continue.

23:23.079 --> 23:25.559
I shall take my leave first.

23:27.519 --> 23:29.039
Everyone, please hold on.

23:32.759 --> 23:34.079
Now that the assassin has been captured,

23:34.720 --> 23:35.799
where is everyone going?

23:37.160 --> 23:38.680
Let's continue drinking

23:38.680 --> 23:39.759
and the entertainment.

23:40.400 --> 23:41.599
That's the proper thing to do.

23:43.119 --> 23:44.119
Exactly, exactly.

23:44.119 --> 23:46.319
I will summon people to clean up immediately.

23:46.319 --> 23:48.160
- Servants.
- No need for that.

23:48.680 --> 23:50.240
Leave it to my men.

23:50.920 --> 23:52.000
They are experienced.

23:53.279 --> 23:54.839
Chuanyu.

23:54.839 --> 23:56.392
Yes.

23:57.359 --> 23:58.359
You know what to do.

23:58.359 --> 24:01.160
- Take the assassin away. Tidy up the scene.
- Yes.

24:01.160 --> 24:02.839
Aren't all corrupt officials afraid of death?

24:03.839 --> 24:05.799
Even so, the Floral Envoy still has the mood

24:05.799 --> 24:07.160
to continue feasting.

24:07.160 --> 24:09.119
One who is shameless never
worries about anything.

24:10.160 --> 24:11.720
- Shameless Jiang.
- Kneel properly.

24:12.759 --> 24:13.920
Ladies and gentlemen, please.

24:13.920 --> 24:15.000
Please move to the garden.

24:17.400 --> 24:18.824
This way, please.

24:32.519 --> 24:34.720
Seeing how proficient these subordinates are,

24:35.480 --> 24:37.880
I can't help but want to shout 'bravo'.

24:40.920 --> 24:42.440
Although I don't mind assassination,

24:43.200 --> 24:44.599
before I came,

24:44.599 --> 24:45.920
His Majesty specifically instructed me

24:46.480 --> 24:47.720
to see if Luoyang

24:47.720 --> 24:49.799
is as outstanding and spiritually
vibrant as the rumors say.

24:50.400 --> 24:51.440
How should I report

24:52.039 --> 24:53.279
today's events to His Majesty

24:54.039 --> 24:55.799
when I return to Chang'an?

24:56.680 --> 24:57.759
I…

24:57.759 --> 24:59.119
Mr. Liu, there's no need for this.

25:00.000 --> 25:01.640
I don't need your courtesies.

25:03.359 --> 25:05.359
Well, Floral Envoy,

25:05.359 --> 25:06.640
how much tangible courtesy

25:06.640 --> 25:08.359
can exempt one from the crime of negligence?

25:11.200 --> 25:12.319
This crime

25:12.960 --> 25:14.799
can be big or small,

25:14.799 --> 25:16.079
depending on how fast

25:16.079 --> 25:17.440
my returning carriage goes.

25:18.960 --> 25:20.599
I am a forgetful person.

25:21.559 --> 25:23.839
If the journey back is long enough,

25:24.359 --> 25:25.920
by the time I return to Chang'an,

25:25.920 --> 25:27.039
I will have forgotten everything.

25:27.640 --> 25:29.519
Then, His Majesty will only know that Luoyang

25:30.039 --> 25:32.559
is warm with flowers blooming
and the common folk prospering.

25:34.559 --> 25:35.720
The gifts for His Majesty

25:35.720 --> 25:37.160
and the Floral Envoy

25:37.160 --> 25:39.839
will be enough to make it difficult
for the horses to take a step.

25:39.839 --> 25:41.000
Please rest assured.

25:44.000 --> 25:45.279
Mr. Liu is a clear-headed person.

25:46.039 --> 25:47.640
In the future, you will certainly

25:47.640 --> 25:49.000
rise rapidly through the ranks.

25:50.400 --> 25:51.920
Thank you, Floral Envoy.

25:54.720 --> 25:56.279
Having had plenty of wine and food,

25:56.279 --> 25:57.720
why not play something

25:57.720 --> 25:58.960
to stretch our limbs a bit?

25:59.880 --> 26:01.880
I remember that Zishu is quite fond of archery.

26:02.519 --> 26:04.039
Do you have a target for archery?

26:04.039 --> 26:05.319
Yes, yes.

26:05.960 --> 26:07.160
County Princess, please.

26:10.519 --> 26:11.944
Please.

26:15.079 --> 26:16.720
Mudan, go prepare some refreshments.

26:35.039 --> 26:36.400
- After you, Suizhi.
- Please.

26:54.200 --> 26:55.519
How did it go off-target?

26:56.079 --> 26:57.480
Jiang.

26:57.480 --> 26:59.079
A gust of spring breeze just came by.

26:59.079 --> 27:00.680
Although it messed up your aim,

27:00.680 --> 27:03.640
it is a good omen of success
in the spring breeze.

27:03.640 --> 27:04.759
Jiang.

27:04.759 --> 27:06.319
Joyous events are approaching.

27:06.319 --> 27:08.359
You have such sayings in Luoyang.

27:20.839 --> 27:22.440
Well…

27:22.440 --> 27:24.039
No competing for the colors of spring,

27:24.039 --> 27:26.880
in autumn, it shall ascend
into the cloud-filled skies.

27:26.880 --> 27:28.200
Floral Envoy.

27:28.200 --> 27:30.519
This truly is a great omen of good fortune.

27:31.240 --> 27:32.640
- That's right.
- Well said, well said.

27:32.640 --> 27:33.720
Great fortune, great fortune.

27:33.720 --> 27:35.559
Great fortune, oh great fortune.

28:03.519 --> 28:04.720
Archery is uninteresting.

28:05.240 --> 28:07.480
Better to switch to pitching pots, huh?

28:07.480 --> 28:08.799
- Alright.
- Pitching pots.

28:08.799 --> 28:09.799
Right, right.

28:09.799 --> 28:11.480
Pitching pots, pitching pots is good.

28:11.480 --> 28:13.680
Let's all go to the garden to pitch pots.

28:14.240 --> 28:15.759
County Princess, please.

28:17.839 --> 28:19.720
- Let's go.
- Please, please, please.

28:19.720 --> 28:21.400
After you.

28:21.400 --> 28:23.000
- Jiang.
- You go ahead.

28:40.599 --> 28:43.359
Why does this person
deliberately hide his abilities?

28:43.359 --> 28:45.559
And why did he aim solely
at this wealth-attracting copper coin?

28:52.759 --> 28:53.799
A small token of appreciation.

28:53.799 --> 28:55.440
- Thank you.
- Take care, take care.

28:56.440 --> 28:57.720
Mr. Li, here you go.

28:57.720 --> 28:59.480
Thank you.

28:59.480 --> 29:00.640
Mrs. Zhang, please take care on your way.

29:00.640 --> 29:02.119
- Thank you.
- See you again.

29:03.880 --> 29:05.512
Thank you.

29:06.319 --> 29:08.079
I just ran into that lad at the second gate

29:08.079 --> 29:09.160
and found out

29:09.160 --> 29:11.119
that those carriages brought
by the Floral Envoy

29:11.119 --> 29:12.240
were all empty.

29:13.559 --> 29:16.039
Those carriages were personally
bestowed by His Majesty,

29:16.039 --> 29:18.160
representing the supreme
honor and favor of His Majesty.

29:18.160 --> 29:19.640
And the rule of the Floral Envoy is

29:19.640 --> 29:20.720
to travel with empty carriages

29:20.720 --> 29:22.039
and return fully loaded.

29:22.039 --> 29:23.720
Indeed, he is the number
one greedy official in the world.

29:24.519 --> 29:26.240
The Floral Envoy is unfathomable,

29:26.240 --> 29:28.000
and not as simple as he appears.

29:28.000 --> 29:29.480
Let's not interfere with this matter.

29:29.480 --> 29:31.599
The most important thing is to go
and find the lady of the house

29:31.599 --> 29:33.599
to move the peonies back
to my courtyard as soon as possible.

29:33.599 --> 29:34.720
Only then can I be at ease.

29:35.559 --> 29:38.480
But it's impossible for Mudan to raise
so much money all at once.

29:38.480 --> 29:39.920
And there is no way to get it from home.

29:40.440 --> 29:41.799
It seems

29:41.799 --> 29:43.599
that the only option is to sell
the imperial-granted Zixi pills

29:43.599 --> 29:44.759
in order to raise the funds.

29:46.920 --> 29:48.039
The tribute medicine can save lives

29:48.039 --> 29:49.480
when the time comes.

29:49.480 --> 29:50.920
They can never be sold.

29:52.400 --> 29:53.519
When He entered the family,

29:53.519 --> 29:55.400
didn't her father give us a large sum of money?

29:56.279 --> 29:57.519
Now it's all spent.

29:57.519 --> 29:58.759
How have you been managing the household?

29:59.720 --> 30:00.839
My Lord.

30:00.839 --> 30:03.079
Two distinguished guests have come.

30:03.079 --> 30:04.559
Not to mention the expenses

30:04.559 --> 30:05.920
of the banquet hosted for them,

30:05.920 --> 30:08.319
they are going to stay here for a while.

30:08.319 --> 30:09.400
Even if we had a gold mine,

30:09.400 --> 30:10.480
it would not be enough.

30:10.480 --> 30:11.480
Women simply

30:11.480 --> 30:12.599
lack foresight.

30:13.680 --> 30:15.039
The future career prospects of our son

30:15.559 --> 30:17.119
and the Liu family's reputation

30:17.119 --> 30:18.599
all depend on these few days.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.799
But right now…

30:20.799 --> 30:22.119
Didn't someone make an offer

30:22.799 --> 30:23.880
on He's dowry,

30:23.880 --> 30:24.960
those few shops?

30:25.480 --> 30:26.880
Have Xiangfu take the accountant

30:26.880 --> 30:28.000
and sell them.

30:28.000 --> 30:29.119
It should tide us over for a while.

30:32.000 --> 30:34.000
Don't even think about touching
the tribute medicine.

30:34.000 --> 30:35.839
We must not let He discover

30:35.839 --> 30:38.279
that what we gave back then was a forgery.

30:38.279 --> 30:39.880
If her father gets wind of it,

30:39.880 --> 30:43.039
it will be difficult to ask him for money
to grease the wheels in the future.

32:03.039 --> 32:04.039
Don't act impulsively.

32:05.599 --> 32:06.680
Let's go back first.

32:08.839 --> 32:10.344
Let's go back,

32:28.400 --> 32:29.759
I thought…

32:30.799 --> 32:33.000
I thought Mother was too ill.

32:34.960 --> 32:36.839
Even with the expensive Zixi pills,

32:36.839 --> 32:38.440
it didn't turn the tide.

32:39.759 --> 32:41.160
But I never expected…

32:43.480 --> 32:45.440
I never expected the pills to be fake.

32:47.640 --> 32:49.400
Why did they deceive me?

32:50.519 --> 32:51.559
Why?

32:52.839 --> 32:54.720
I clearly could have had more time.

32:55.920 --> 32:57.640
I could have more time

32:57.640 --> 32:58.880
to look for other miraculous medicines.

32:58.880 --> 33:00.000
My lady.

33:00.000 --> 33:02.039
My lady, don't be like this, my lady.

33:03.880 --> 33:05.032
My lady.

33:14.519 --> 33:15.880
It's all because of my incompetence.

33:17.640 --> 33:19.119
It's all because of my incompetence.

33:20.759 --> 33:22.160
If I had discovered earlier

33:22.160 --> 33:23.880
that the Zixi pills were fake,

33:24.680 --> 33:26.160
I could have wasted no time

33:26.160 --> 33:27.480
in seeking medical advice.

33:29.000 --> 33:30.279
Mother…

33:30.279 --> 33:33.200
Mother might have been saved.

33:35.160 --> 33:37.279
She wouldn't have left me.

33:39.559 --> 33:43.960
I was foolish, I was too foolish.

33:43.960 --> 33:45.079
Don't be like this, my lady.

33:45.079 --> 33:46.480
Don't be like this.

33:48.079 --> 33:49.160
My lady.

33:51.640 --> 33:53.680
The Master has been selling
medicine for so many years,

33:53.680 --> 33:55.640
but he's never seen a real Zixi pill.

33:56.279 --> 33:58.519
The fake medicine and the one
described in the medical books

33:58.519 --> 34:01.119
smell and appear exactly the same.

34:01.119 --> 34:02.880
Furthermore, as soon as Madam took it,

34:02.880 --> 34:04.799
there indeed was some improvement.

34:04.799 --> 34:07.200
It's only natural that you didn't notice.

34:07.839 --> 34:09.639
It's the Liu family to blame,

34:09.639 --> 34:10.679
not you, my lady.

34:11.599 --> 34:12.719
My lady,

34:12.719 --> 34:14.719
if Madam sees you

34:14.719 --> 34:17.320
this heartbroken and self-reproaching,

34:17.320 --> 34:19.039
she will definitely be heartbroken.

34:23.639 --> 34:24.639
That's right.

34:26.079 --> 34:28.960
I shouldn't torment myself for such a family.

34:30.800 --> 34:32.679
Their lies have delayed

34:33.440 --> 34:35.760
the treatment period for Mother.

34:38.000 --> 34:39.079
I will certainly make them

34:39.079 --> 34:40.360
pay the price.

34:41.920 --> 34:42.920
I will certainly make them

34:42.920 --> 34:44.199
pay the price.

34:44.840 --> 34:47.400
But we are weak and alone.

34:47.400 --> 34:48.639
How can we fight against them?

34:52.800 --> 34:54.360
If we confront them now,

34:56.599 --> 34:58.239
they will surely deny everything.

34:59.679 --> 35:00.679
How about…

35:00.679 --> 35:01.760
How about we tell

35:01.760 --> 35:02.840
the Master about this

35:02.840 --> 35:04.239
to seek justice?

35:05.480 --> 35:06.760
No.

35:07.440 --> 35:09.199
We have no evidence now.

35:10.000 --> 35:11.800
Even if we involve Father,

35:12.480 --> 35:13.840
it would be of no help.

35:15.039 --> 35:17.039
Even if we turn Liu's house upside down

35:17.039 --> 35:18.599
and find the real tribute medicine,

35:19.639 --> 35:21.159
they will not admit it.

35:22.320 --> 35:23.840
When that happens and the families fall out,

35:25.079 --> 35:27.199
we of the He family, being mere merchants,

35:28.000 --> 35:29.000
might bear the stigma

35:29.000 --> 35:30.480
of being ungrateful and treacherous.

35:34.039 --> 35:35.440
What we can do now

35:36.559 --> 35:38.480
is to withdraw from the Liu family intact.

35:39.880 --> 35:40.920
Once we get home,

35:41.599 --> 35:42.960
we'll plan our next step.

35:45.239 --> 35:46.952
In any case,

35:48.159 --> 35:49.719
I cannot stay a moment longer

35:50.960 --> 35:53.000
at this place of cruelty.

35:54.079 --> 35:55.400
My lady, you want a divorce.

35:58.639 --> 36:00.200
That's right.

36:08.800 --> 36:11.119
Liu Shen insisted on me
marrying into the Liu family

36:12.519 --> 36:14.360
for my birth characters.

36:15.440 --> 36:17.599
He will surely not let me go easily.

36:20.960 --> 36:22.679
Tomorrow the Liu family will accompany
the County Princess on a trip.

36:23.599 --> 36:25.440
We can take this opportunity

36:25.440 --> 36:27.119
to take back the dowry shops.

36:28.599 --> 36:30.320
We must not let them sell them at will.

36:38.000 --> 36:39.240
My lady.

36:43.679 --> 36:45.679
Liu Shen does not want to let me leave.

36:47.480 --> 36:48.719
But the County Princess and Liu Chang

36:48.719 --> 36:50.280
can't wait for me to disappear.

36:55.119 --> 36:57.719
Yulu, pass the message for me.

37:11.679 --> 37:12.679
Why did you

37:12.679 --> 37:14.216
call me here?

37:19.599 --> 37:20.800
Everyone thinks

37:22.119 --> 37:23.679
that peonies are exclusive to the nobility.

37:25.639 --> 37:27.000
But they forget

37:27.000 --> 37:28.239
that they originate
from the mountains and forests

37:29.880 --> 37:31.559
and once bloomed

37:32.599 --> 37:33.960
and withered away freely.

37:36.639 --> 37:37.920
The flowers before us

37:40.199 --> 37:42.199
are the fine specimens

37:43.280 --> 37:44.519
gathered by Mother while accompanying
Father on his business trips

37:44.519 --> 37:45.760
traveling across all regions.

37:47.280 --> 37:49.480
Mother brought them to me

37:51.119 --> 37:53.159
and taught me how to cultivate them with care.

37:55.679 --> 37:57.000
Without my mother,

37:58.679 --> 37:59.679
there wouldn't be the grand spectacle

37:59.679 --> 38:02.119
that made the County Princess
and the Floral Envoy

38:02.119 --> 38:04.159
praise unanimously.

38:06.199 --> 38:08.000
Did you call me here just to tell me

38:08.599 --> 38:10.400
how precious these beloved
golden nuggets of yours are,

38:10.400 --> 38:11.800
how rare they are,

38:11.800 --> 38:14.280
and how magnificent you were
at today's floral banquet?

38:18.159 --> 38:19.800
If you wish to bestow a reward,

38:19.800 --> 38:21.440
you may say so directly.

38:21.440 --> 38:22.920
For the sake of these flowers,

38:22.920 --> 38:24.159
as long as it's not too excessive,

38:25.239 --> 38:26.519
I can agree to it.

38:35.440 --> 38:36.840
I want a divorce.

38:38.559 --> 38:39.816
What did you say?

38:40.320 --> 38:41.672
I said,

38:42.360 --> 38:43.679
I want a divorce.

38:45.559 --> 38:46.952
What nonsense are you talking about?

38:58.559 --> 38:59.840
Is it because of me and the County Princess?

39:01.320 --> 39:02.519
My relationship with Youzhen…

39:02.519 --> 39:04.159
That's right.

39:04.159 --> 39:06.719
You and the County Princess
are mutually in love,

39:07.639 --> 39:09.440
a match made in heaven.

39:10.599 --> 39:11.880
While my status is humble,

39:12.440 --> 39:14.199
detrimental to your reputation, so,

39:15.000 --> 39:16.719
I am willing to leave the Liu family

39:16.719 --> 39:17.840
to make your relationship possible.

39:23.440 --> 39:25.559
You speak so many self-deprecating words

39:26.360 --> 39:28.239
to grant yourself a favor, don't you?

39:29.880 --> 39:31.000
Indeed.

39:31.000 --> 39:32.599
Merchants value profit over righteousness.

39:33.320 --> 39:34.639
Don't forget

39:34.639 --> 39:35.840
that it was the He family

39:35.840 --> 39:36.840
who came asking for medicine.

39:37.840 --> 39:39.400
And now that the benefits are exhausted,

39:39.920 --> 39:41.199
you think of breaking the agreement.

39:42.679 --> 39:43.760
Our marriage began

39:44.519 --> 39:46.159
all because of a sorcerer's words.

39:47.360 --> 39:48.920
Even if there's no commiseration,

39:49.880 --> 39:51.679
you should understand the other's helplessness.

39:53.119 --> 39:54.400
Since you're weary of me

39:55.079 --> 39:56.480
and this marriage arrangement,

39:56.480 --> 39:57.800
why not let me leave?

39:58.559 --> 39:59.840
This way, you'll also be free.

39:59.840 --> 40:01.159
I disagree.

40:03.719 --> 40:04.936
Why?

40:06.039 --> 40:08.000
Isn't this what you've always wanted?

40:08.000 --> 40:09.199
What I want

40:09.199 --> 40:10.639
is not for you to decide.

40:12.960 --> 40:14.159
You married into the Liu family.

40:14.159 --> 40:16.800
Where you go and what you do
is all decided by me, your husband.

40:17.639 --> 40:19.320
I have not yet said I will divorce you.

40:19.840 --> 40:21.480
On what grounds do you
bring up divorce with me?

40:29.280 --> 40:30.320
Matters of divorce

40:30.840 --> 40:32.039
won't be my initiative.

40:32.880 --> 40:35.199
You can submit documents to the authorities.

40:35.920 --> 40:37.159
In the eyes of the public,

40:38.079 --> 40:39.400
it will be you getting rid of me.

40:40.000 --> 40:41.280
In your eyes, do I care that much

40:41.280 --> 40:42.320
about how those unrelated people

40:42.320 --> 40:43.920
see me, is that it?

40:43.920 --> 40:45.159
- Liu Chang.
- What I truly care about

40:45.159 --> 40:46.559
is whether my marriage stays or ends

40:46.559 --> 40:47.880
is all up to me.

40:50.480 --> 40:52.360
Others have no right to manipulate me,

40:52.360 --> 40:53.519
let alone you.

40:56.159 --> 40:57.679
He Weifang, listen well to me.

40:58.239 --> 41:00.440
Although our marriage lacks substance,

41:00.440 --> 41:01.880
the name of it

41:01.880 --> 41:03.679
is not for you to just discard.

41:04.679 --> 41:05.800
Unless I divorce you,

41:06.480 --> 41:08.199
otherwise, don't think of leaving this place.

41:36.772 --> 41:43.046
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

41:44.900 --> 41:51.584
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

41:52.260 --> 41:59.458
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:00.452 --> 42:08.804
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:08.804 --> 42:16.347
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:17.001 --> 42:25.188
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:25.188 --> 42:32.999
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

42:33.604 --> 42:40.896
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:01.572 --> 43:08.455
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:09.756 --> 43:16.450
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the fragrant garden ♫

43:17.207 --> 43:24.509
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:25.193 --> 43:33.502
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

43:33.502 --> 43:40.933
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

43:41.764 --> 43:50.020
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

43:50.020 --> 43:57.444
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

43:58.448 --> 44:05.898
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
